# Real RuntimeHarness.log excerpts, captured against a live Skyrim AE 1.6.1170
# process (SKSE64 2.2.6), 2026-08-26. Trimmed to the relevant sections and
# lightly redacted (character-name fields in save filenames replaced with
# XXXXXXXXXXXX -- some of CommonLibSSE-NG's savegame filename fields embed a
# hex-encoded character name; everything else, including all timestamps and
# form IDs, is unmodified real output). Full session logs are much longer
# (900+ lines); this is not the complete file.

